#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Replicate a captured production cgroup hierarchy in a cgroup-v2 sandbox.

Recreates the full cgroup tree from a host dump (embedded below as HIERARCHY)
under a sandbox root, enabling the cpu controller on every internal node and
setting cpu.max on the few leaves that were actually limited (LIMITS). This
reproduces the "thousands of cgroups, only a handful cpu.max-limited" shape
used to stress lib/cgroup_bw.

Dry-run by default; pass --apply to actually create/remove cgroups (needs
root). --teardown removes the sandbox.
"""
